{
  "uid": "bun-profiler-demo",
  "title": "bun-profiler demo",
  "tags": [
    "bun-profiler",
    "profiling"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "bun-profiler-demo",
        "current": {
          "text": "bun-profiler-demo",
          "value": "bun-profiler-demo"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## CPU time vs wall-clock time\n\nThe two flamegraphs below are built from **the same samples**, weighted differently.\n\n- **CPU** answers *where is the processor busy?* Idle time is excluded entirely.\n- **Wall** answers *where does elapsed time go?* Time spent parked off-CPU is bucketed into an explicit `(idle)` frame.\n\nOn an I/O-heavy service the CPU flamegraph points at whichever pricing or parsing loop is hottest, while the wall flamegraph shows that most of the request was spent waiting. Run `dev/loadgen.sh` to fill these in."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "flamegraph",
      "title": "CPU profile — on-CPU time only",
      "description": "process_cpu. Idle/off-CPU time is excluded, so this shows what the processor is actually working on.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource",
        "uid": "pyroscope"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "profile",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource",
            "uid": "pyroscope"
          },
          "profileTypeId": "process_cpu:cpu:nanoseconds:cpu:nanoseconds",
          "labelSelector": "{service_name=\"$service\"}",
          "groupBy": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "flamegraph",
      "title": "Wall profile — elapsed time, including (idle)",
      "description": "wall. Time spent parked on I/O appears as the (idle) frame instead of inflating whichever function resumed afterwards.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource",
        "uid": "pyroscope"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "profile",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource",
            "uid": "pyroscope"
          },
          "profileTypeId": "wall:wall:nanoseconds:cpu:nanoseconds",
          "labelSelector": "{service_name=\"$service\"}",
          "groupBy": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by route",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(demo_http_requests_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 latency by route",
      "description": "Compare /api/io/waterfall against /api/io/parallel — same four queries, serial vs concurrent.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (route, le) (rate(demo_http_request_duration_ms_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
